# Binary assets: never apply text/EOL or diff filters. A PDF that gets
# decoded as UTF-8 and re-encoded loses every non-ASCII byte to U+FFFD,
# which leaves the page structure intact but renders every page blank.
*.pdf   binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.webp  binary
*.ico   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf   binary
*.otf   binary
*.mp4   binary
